      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHERE'S FERNANDO (7) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 0.8 lengths at Bulli in a handy 19.15 beating Magic Linkin. Wide box to overcome but goes well at this distance. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Can continue on his winning ways. KAYCEE TRACEY (2) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 19.97 beating JACOBITE BATTLE. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Leading chance again. GIGGLE HAT (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with five wins and eight minors from 14 tries. Hit the frame latest (25.14) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Can feature in the finish. CLEAN ENGINES (1) was in the money last time at this track (19.97) in a Mix 2/3, finishing a 2.25 lengths second. Has already won three times from this draw.",
